  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 14 files needed for the RealmExport schema-migration impact analysis, most important first:\n\n1. **`zerver/models/realm_audit_logs.py`** \u2014 defines `RealmAuditLog`/`AbstractRealmAuditLog` and `AuditLogEventType.REALM_EXPORTED`, the current tracking mechanism (`extra_data` JSONField) that `RealmExport` replaces.\n2. **`zerver/models/realms.py`** \u2014 defines `EXPORT_PUBLIC`/`EXPORT_FULL_WITH_CONSENT`/`EXPORT_FULL_WITHOUT_CONSENT` constants used throughout the export flow.\n3. **`zerver/models/__init__.py`** \u2014 model registration point where `RealmExport` needs to be imported/re-exported.\n4. **`zerver/lib/export.py`** \u2014 core export logic; `get_realm_exports_serialized()` (serializes tracking data for the frontend) and `export_realm_wrapper`/`do_export_realm` live here.\n5. **`zerver/actions/realm_export.py`** \u2014 actions layer: `notify_realm_export()` and `do_delete_realm_export()`, both read/write the JSON tracking data.\n6. **`zerver/views/realm_export.py`** \u2014 views serving export status/creation/deletion to the frontend (`export_realm`, `get_realm_exports`, `delete_realm_export`, `get_users_export_consents`).\n7. **`zerver/worker/deferred_work.py`** \u2014 background worker (`DeferredWorker.consume`, `type == \"realm_export\"`) that runs the actual export and read/writes `extra_data` at each stage (started/failed/export_path timestamps).\n8. **`zerver/management/commands/export.py`** \u2014 CLI export command, creates the `RealmAuditLog` tracking row directly.\n9. **`zerver/lib/upload/__init__.py`** \u2014 `upload_export_tarball`/`delete_export_tarball`, tied to the `export_path` stored in tracking data.\n10. **`zproject/urls.py`** \u2014 registers the `export/realm` endpoints to the views above.\n11. **`zerver/tests/test_realm_export.py`** \u2014 dedicated export tests (S3 + local uploads, failure/retry, rate limiting, deletion) that directly assert on `RealmAuditLog.extra_data` fields needing to move to `RealmExport` fields.\n12. **`zerver/tests/test_import_export.py`** \u2014 import/export round-trip tests.\n13. **`zerver/tests/test_management_commands.py`** \u2014 `TestExport` class covers the CLI command path.\n14. **`zerver/tests/test_events.py`** \u2014 event-system tests likely covering the `realm_export` event type emitted by `notify_realm_export`.\n\nNote: the migration file `zerver/migrations/0595_add_realmexport_table_and_backfill.py` referenced in the task does not exist in this repo snapshot \u2014 it's presumably the pending change under review, not yet present in the indexed codebase.",
